{title: 451 - Together Let Us Sweetly Live}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #451 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 451}
{meta: category Early Advent - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C7]To[F]gether [C]let us [F]sweet[Bb]ly [F]live,
I am bound for the [Bb]land [C7]of [F]Canaan.
[C7]To[F]gether [C]love [C7]to [F]Je[Bb]sus [F]give;
I am [Am]bound [Dm]for the [Bb]land [D7]of [F]Canaan.
O Canaan, bright [Bb]Ca[C7]naan,
[C]I am [F]bound for the [C]land [F]of [Csus]C [C]anaan.
[C7]O[Dm]Ca[F]naan, it [Gm7]is[C7]my [F]hap[Bb]py [F]home,
I am [Am]bound [Dm]for the [Bb]land [D7]of [F]Canaan.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[C7][F]O [C]Canaan, [F][Bb]bright [F]Canaan,
[Bb]I am [C7]bound for the [F]land of Canaan.
[C7]O [F]Canaan, [C]it [C7]is [F]my [Bb]happy [F]home,
[Am]I [Dm]am bound [Bb]for [D7]the land [F]of Canaan.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[C7]Together [F]let [C]us [F]watch [Bb]and [F]pray;
[Bb]I am [C7]bound for the [F]land of Canaan.
[C7][F]And [C]wait [C7][F]redemption's [Bb]joyous [F]day;
[Am]I [Dm]am bound [Bb]for [D7]the land [F]of Canaan.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[C7]Our [F]songs [C]of praise [F]shall [Bb]fill [F]the skies;
[Bb]I am [C7]bound for the [F]land of Canaan.
[C7]While [F]higher [C]still [C7]our [F]joys [Bb]shall [F]rise;
[Am]I [Dm]am bound [Bb]for [D7]the land [F]of Canaan.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[C7]Then [F]come [C]with [F]me, [Bb]beloved [F]friend;
[Bb]I am [C7]bound for the [F]land of Canaan.
[C7]The [F]joys [C]to [C7]come [F]shall [Bb]never [F]end;
[Am]I [Dm]am bound [Bb]for [D7]the land [F]of Canaan.
{end_of_verse}
